{
  "id": "interplanal-champions",
  "title": "Interplanal Champions: The Throne of Avernus",
  "description": "<p>A level 12–17 D&amp;D 5e campaign of infernal succession, the sequel to <em>The Night of the Red Clause</em>. Asmodeus opens the throne of Avernus to challengers who can prove Survival, Deviousness and Dominion, and every crown is a contract. Twenty-two vector battlemaps (the six 2020 originals rebuilt, plus their keyed locations), a full bestiary with automation including Misty, Hell Hag Queen, six level-12 claimants, three new subclasses, seventeen contractual spells, fourteen relics, the Championship Charter and eight contract forms, roll tables, the Championship Board and arena, tribunal and mass-battle tools. One-click setup.</p>",
